OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells through the evening,
OL,7,Fperhaps a touch of frost developing,
OL,8,FClouding over from the south later as
OL,9,Frain spreads north by dawn.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FA wet start for most areas and
OL,12,Fwindy around the coasts, rain will be
OL,13,Fheavy and persistent at times during
OL,14,Fthe day, turning lighter later for
OL,15,Fwestern areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
